 "sentences": [
  {
   "sid": "4-03.s1",
   "text": "But look closer.",
   "w_first": "4-03.w001",
   "w_last": "4-03.w003",
   "f0": 9,
   "f1": 57
  },
  {
   "sid": "4-03.s2",
   "text": "One end of the protein, a floppy tail, had really low confidence.",
   "w_first": "4-03.w004",
   "w_last": "4-03.w015",
   "f0": 117,
   "f1": 428
  },
  {
   "sid": "4-03.s3",
   "text": "And in the model, it lay across the keyhole, with one building block sitting inside the ATP pocket.",
   "w_first": "4-03.w016",
   "w_last": "4-03.w033",
   "f0": 490,
   "f1": 915
  },
  {
   "sid": "4-03.s4",
   "text": "Trust it blindly, and you'd cut keys for a blocked door.",
   "w_first": "4-03.w034",
   "w_last": "4-03.w044",
   "f0": 956,
   "f1": 1184
  }
 ],
